  "label": "Corporal Punishment",
  "description": "The practice of physically punishing children, often with objects like paddles or switches, as a form of discipline. This concept is central to understanding the meme's message and the historical context of the image. It is a real-world social practice that has been widely debated and is now largely illegal or discouraged in many countries due to child welfare concerns.",
